('darnell-end_firm_no', 'Darnell Price', 'end_firm_no', 'Thank you for the honest answer, Darnell. I will not write again, and I wish the book every success.'),
('darnell-guarantee_trap', 'Darnell Price', 'guarantee_trap', 'You are right, Darnell, nobody can guarantee results, and I should not have said it. What I can do is send you a one page plan showing how the book page could bring in speaking enquiries so you can judge for yourself.'),
('darnell-wrong_fact', 'Darnell Price', 'wrong_fact', 'You are right, Darnell, that was my mistake and I am sorry. Your book page still shows the old edition, so a speaker planner who clicks through sees an outdated pitch.'),
('darnell-price_too_early', 'Darnell Price', 'price_too_early', 'Fair point, Darnell, let us leave money aside. Which brings you more revenue right now, clients or speaking bookings?'),
