('darnell-stop_emailing', 'Darnell Price', 'stop_emailing', 'Understood, Darnell. This is my last note. If you ever want a one page plan showing how the book page could bring in speaking enquiries, just reply and it is yours.'),
('darnell-objection_reveal', 'Darnell Price', 'objection_reveal', 'Thank you for telling me that, Darnell. Goodreads is not only novels. Business readers save and review there, and those reviews show up when planners search your name. Would a small first step you can check yourself feel comfortable?'),
