('darnell-warming', 'Darnell Price', 'warming', 'I am glad, Darnell. The first step is a one page plan showing how the book page could bring in speaking enquiries. Are you happy for me to send it today?'),
('darnell-agree_small_step', 'Darnell Price', 'agree_small_step', 'Thank you, Darnell. I will send it today, and once you have seen it we can agree the scope, timeline and terms in writing.'),
