('priya-no_reply', 'Priya Raman', 'no_reply', 'Hi Priya, The letters structure in Monsoon Letters is unusual and beautiful. Your small press did a lovely launch, and I noticed the book has not appeared on the literary fiction lists where readers browse since. Would you like me to send you a short note on the three lists where it fits, which your publisher is welcome to see?'),
('priya-who_are_you', 'Priya Raman', 'who_are_you', 'Hi Priya, my name is Emmanuel Sunday and I run HQ360 at hq360.space. I wrote because your small press did a lovely launch, and I noticed the book has not appeared on the literary fiction lists where readers browse since. Would it help if I sent you a short note on the three lists where it fits, which your publisher is welcome to see?'),
('priya-rude', 'Priya Raman', 'rude', 'Hi Priya, you are right that you did not ask for this, and I am sorry for the intrusion. Your small press did a lovely launch, and I noticed the book has not appeared on the literary fiction lists where readers browse since. If that is ever useful, would you like me to send it?'),
('priya-end_firm_no', 'Priya Raman', 'end_firm_no', 'Thank you for the honest answer, Priya. I will not write again, and I wish the book every success.'),
('priya-guarantee_trap', 'Priya Raman', 'guarantee_trap', 'You are right, Priya, nobody can guarantee results, and I should not have said it. What I can do is send you a short note on the three lists where it fits, which your publisher is welcome to see so you can judge for yourself.'),
